//! Drum reference statistics: generated by tools/drum_target.py from DRSKit 2.1
//! (DrumGizmo team, drumgizmo.org, CC BY 4.0), statistics only; do not edit by hand.
//!
//! Per voice and velocity layer (soft, medium, hard): the 1/3-octave band curve
//! (dB relative to the hit's total, first 0.6 s), the amplitude decay time
//! constant per octave band, the level against the hard layer, the attack time;
//! per voice the strong modes of the medium layer. Perspective and definitions:
//! docs/engine-design.md section 5.8 and the header of tools/drum_target.py.

